;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=げき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=まつよいづき, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=56, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=だま, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=6413008, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   14: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=きびす, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   15: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   16: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   17: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=みつどもえ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   18: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=わな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=3725, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=3425, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "escape.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\荒田枯れ木.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The one who appeared there was the missing <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she had been watching our exchange. Gripping a knife, she cut in between us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what was going on? <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was covered in blood, and the bleeding from her face was especially bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe her wounds weren't as bad as they looked. <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> showed no sign of minding the bleeding, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> went to the abandoned hut out toward Toyotake! All of you, take shelter there too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, but that place is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Show them the way! There's no time! Leave this to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"G-got it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Hurry!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The abandoned hut out toward Toyotake―according to <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, the two of them are there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, we're being asked to go there too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently it's important enough for <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to be <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="てい">putting herself</STYLE> on the line, resolved to see this through.<PG>
I have a mountain of things to ask <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, but our safety comes first.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> leading the way, we'll try to break through.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神鉈振り上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"W-wait!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The resident standing at the very front raised a nata high.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
But <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> at once planted herself in front of that resident.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Don't get in my way. I mean it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you lay a hand on those girls... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll kill you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">! Hurry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\砂利を走る2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I cast a glance toward <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE> forcibly pulled me away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, are you really all right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did you really do that just to protect us?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Pull yourself together!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="げき">barked</STYLE> at me, my steps slowed by hesitation, was <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if her voice had woken me up, my feet started moving too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked back toward <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> once more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\茅萱ナイフ血.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, her knife leveled at that group―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is she going to fight them after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Things beyond my understanding are already happening in this Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hah... hah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly my field of vision opened up, and we came out into a clearing with a commanding view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sprinting 200 meters down a gravel road I wasn't used to had been pretty hard work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and I stopped here to catch our breath.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE>, without the slightest sign of being out of breath, was looking at the sky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And carefully, as if feeling out our surroundings, she gazed quietly up at the sky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the sky hung the big <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="まつよいづき">moon</STYLE>, one night short of full.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From that moon, what do we look like?<PG>
Something like a boss mushroom called <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> has taken over this whole area, parasitized human beings, and caused all this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... maybe the ones who took over this land were the humans.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> had been rooted here since long ago, blended into the natural world, and yet one day humans suddenly came along―<PG>
But if I'm asked whose side I'm on, it goes without saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> premonition is right, going back to Motoki-cho as we are will not end the calamity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This has to be settled one way or another, here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then again, there's also a chance that <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> premonition itself is a deception by <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\墓場夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, how much farther to the abandoned hut?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"About 15 minutes on foot, I guess. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But it was pouring around there this evening, so the path is probably a muddy mess. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It's easy to get lost, so don't leave my side, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm... Going back to the settlement now―better not even think about it, right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"With everyone acting like that? It's probably dangerous."</STYLE><PG>
Just as the residents said, wouldn't it have been safer to go straight back to the settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We, at least, might have been safe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But we left the settlement to look for <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> and the others.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since that goal hasn't been achieved, going back to the settlement now is questionable too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"For now, all we can do is go to that abandoned hut, right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True, there seems to be no room for choice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> said it like that, doing as she says is―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, we're going, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Oh, right..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\墓地広場山側.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This clearing was a graveyard, apparently. From here, the path along the cliff led down to the mountain stream, and going on past that would bring us to the mountain path where the abandoned hut was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I walked on, lost in thought.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> knew that <STYLE ID="1">she herself</STYLE> was being sense-hijacked.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of that, if she survived despite being carried off, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> survival skills are formidable.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> has come up with some kind of plan, I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But as long as she's being sense-hijacked, she can't say it out loud, and we have no way of knowing her true intentions.<PG>
Yes―if, just as I'm keeping <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> so that <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is keeping us <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> so that <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> is <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> to fool <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, she has no choice but to fool us.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait a minute... something's nagging at me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Eri-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I stopped walking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I remembered―how <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had disappeared from that storehouse.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Dark_Energy.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\録音.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The corpses had been moving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had clearly said <STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the name <STYLE ID="13">Eiichiro</STYLE>―two corpses had been moving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What matters is how <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> dealt with that situation afterward.<PG>
In other words, either <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> was kidnapped but escaped on her own, or, unfortunately, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> has betrayed us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But from <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> position, either way, she'll at least act in ways that betray us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is being watched by <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> at all times, so she can't help us openly.<PG>
So if she does do something, she'll pretend to betray us and act in a way that helps us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, there's also a chance that <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> has betrayed us, pure and simple...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> would think that far ahead before acting, but now that things have gotten this complicated, I'd better assume nothing will go according to plan.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\崖沿いの道.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, go on to the abandoned hut, just the two of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">I still have something I have to do!"</STYLE>
